<title>FINLAND: NEWS CONFERENCE ABOUT COOPERATION - TIETO .</title>
<headline>NEWS CONFERENCE ABOUT COOPERATION - TIETO .</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data services group TT Tieto Oy said in a statement on Thursday an earlier announced news conference was about &quot;a significant arrangement&quot; related to cooperation in its information technology business area.</p>
<p>The news conference will be held at 1500/1200 GMT, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
